00:32:01.908 --> 00:32:05.608
Ohhh.
That was close.

00:32:05.608 --> 00:32:07.188
Close.
She didn't say it.

00:32:09.028 --> 00:32:10.068
Sorry.
You can't let your guard down.

00:32:10.648 --> 00:32:13.948
Seriously.
I might actually just be a bad person.

00:32:15.328 --> 00:32:20.008
We need to make her eat. If we can make
her eat, she might say it. Make her go back to the buffet.

00:32:20.148 --> 00:32:22.489
Hmm. Maybe put out something like the
chef's recommendation...

00:32:23.429 --> 00:32:25.849
I'll toss that out lightly.
Maybe on three.

00:32:26.629 --> 00:32:28.169
What do we do?
You're hungry, right?

00:32:28.589 --> 00:32:30.169
Wouldn't you say 'over there'? At this
table?

00:32:35.489 --> 00:32:37.249
There it is.
The chef's recommendation.

00:32:37.269 --> 00:32:38.949
Right.
They're baiting her.

00:32:39.849 --> 00:32:41.529
So they think it's one of those.
Yeah.

00:32:42.249 --> 00:32:44.249
Which means three of them.
Huh?

00:32:44.389 --> 00:32:46.209
But me...
I've already ruled some out.

00:32:46.369 --> 00:32:51.269
I already brought back the recommended
pasta. The only move left is for Becky to bring back Japanese food.

00:32:51.269 --> 00:32:53.590
I took prosciutto too.
Ah, then I know.

00:32:54.650 --> 00:32:58.430
Bring me something.
Something I like.

00:32:58.890 --> 00:33:02.890
I see. Pick something from the
recommendations that I'd like.

00:33:02.890 --> 00:33:05.390
But then that would mean Matsumaru picked
it.

00:33:09.050 --> 00:33:10.530
Me too.
No, see...

00:33:11.230 --> 00:33:16.290
Basically this is just us doing something
together, right? The safe thing. Put it here.

00:33:16.290 --> 00:33:20.530
But actually, since it's 2-1, doing things
together is kind of a losing grind here. Yeah.

00:33:20.870 --> 00:33:22.931
Go take that.
Then start by taking it.

00:33:23.271 --> 00:33:25.191
So you're going that way?
Something that seems like I'd like it...

00:33:25.931 --> 00:33:29.631
Please take it.
And I already drank the exchange one.

00:33:29.991 --> 00:33:30.551
Yeah.
You first.

00:33:30.551 --> 00:33:33.531
Yeah.
No, no, no, no.

00:33:33.691 --> 00:33:37.251
Hey, I've already been made to do this
twice. If we're not doing it together, then I can't move either.

00:33:37.451 --> 00:33:41.051
Right. Even at after-parties, when you
grab somebody else's...

00:33:41.751 --> 00:33:45.531
and go, 'Whoa, that's so Becky-like'...
Ah, she said Becky.

00:33:45.731 --> 00:33:48.591
She said Becky.
Ah!

00:33:53.632 --> 00:33:55.792
Ah, now it's 2-2.
NG. One player.

00:33:56.012 --> 00:33:59.992
Alright, now that it's dragged on this
long... when it drags on, the cracks start to show.

00:34:00.492 --> 00:34:03.352
From pushing too hard.
And still no elimination.

00:34:04.632 --> 00:34:07.152
So now we know it's 2-2.
Yep.

00:34:07.372 --> 00:34:08.832
It's 2-2.
No way.

00:34:10.752 --> 00:34:16.472
At 2-2, what a match.

00:34:17.363 --> 00:34:25.053
Should we just eat naturally now?

00:34:26.553 --> 00:34:28.013
Normally?
Let's just eat normally.

00:34:28.273 --> 00:34:30.753
And not overthink it.
Just eat normally without overthinking.

00:34:30.813 --> 00:34:33.313
Yeah.
So if Becky goes for Japanese food now...

00:34:33.493 --> 00:34:35.173
Yeah.
Let's eat.

00:34:35.973 --> 00:34:41.333
Let's do that.
This is incredible.

00:34:41.673 --> 00:34:45.273
She's avoiding it somehow.
That's instinct right there.

00:34:46.533 --> 00:34:47.813
What a championship match.

00:34:48.233 --> 00:34:52.874
And even though they just said, 'Let's
just eat normally,' neither of them is saying things like 'delicious.'

00:34:52.974 --> 00:34:55.574
They're not. It's surprising how they
really won't comment on the taste.

00:34:55.594 --> 00:34:58.374
Yeah.
Wait, hold on, I want some too.

00:34:58.954 --> 00:35:00.114
That's Japanese food.
Get it yourself.

00:35:00.434 --> 00:35:02.874
Ah, this is Japanese.
Bring it over here.

00:35:03.074 --> 00:35:04.094
Yeah.
This is bad.

00:35:04.114 --> 00:35:07.754
I want some.
I want some too.

00:35:09.974 --> 00:35:11.414
Whatever.
Fine, later.

00:35:11.574 --> 00:35:12.574
Ah, later.
It's dessert, after all.

00:35:12.954 --> 00:35:16.714
Why aren't you going for the Japanese one?
Anmitsu?

00:35:17.274 --> 00:35:20.194
Anmitsu.
Ah.

00:35:20.194 --> 00:35:24.134
Maybe Matsumaru should check the anmitsu
first. As for Becky...

00:35:26.835 --> 00:35:30.755
If she maybe goes for the anmitsu here...
if she goes...

00:35:30.915 --> 00:35:35.015
Delicious.
Ah, if she goes...

00:35:35.015 --> 00:35:37.375
Ah, delicious. Ah! There it is. There it
is. In the simplest possible way, at the very end.

00:35:39.835 --> 00:35:42.255
NG. One player.
She said delicious, right?

00:35:42.435 --> 00:35:44.895
Becky said 'delicious.'
We have an elimination.

00:35:45.015 --> 00:35:48.815
An elimination.
The eliminated player is...

00:35:50.845 --> 00:35:51.845
Becky.

00:35:55.505 --> 00:35:56.505
She didn't notice.
Don't say it.

00:35:56.855 --> 00:36:00.836
The winner of Secret NG House is
Matsumaru. Yes!!

00:36:02.516 --> 00:36:05.496
So it really was Matsumaru.
He's strong.

00:36:07.036 --> 00:36:09.696
Whoa, so strong. So it really was food
comments that were banned.

00:36:09.996 --> 00:36:13.116
Yeah. I was actually
avoiding that one.

00:36:13.116 --> 00:36:14.656
Yeah, from the start.
Everyone was avoiding it.

00:36:14.736 --> 00:36:17.236
I was sure that had to be it from the
start, so I tried not to say anything. Absolutely off-limits.

00:36:17.236 --> 00:36:19.596
Yeah, I was trying not to say it too.
Whoa.

00:36:21.886 --> 00:36:22.886
Ah!
That was close.

00:36:22.976 --> 00:36:26.876
That must sting, leaving her in until
here. Because she was winning, basically.

00:36:27.056 --> 00:36:29.196
It really was good, though.

00:36:30.516 --> 00:36:35.957
Now we'll reveal what the secret NGs in
this stage were. Saying a person's name, right?

00:36:36.597 --> 00:36:38.997
So it was names and 'delicious.'
Commenting that the food tastes good.

00:36:39.057 --> 00:36:40.737
And the third one...
Saying a person's name.

00:36:40.737 --> 00:36:41.737
Right.
Ah.

00:36:42.057 --> 00:36:43.457
Yeah, because Kasuga...
Right.

00:36:43.477 --> 00:36:46.917
It was eating or drinking something and
giving an impression of it. What?!

00:36:46.997 --> 00:36:49.217
Of course you'd say it!
You totally would.

00:36:50.057 --> 00:36:56.097
And the last one was putting Japanese,
Western, and Chinese dishes all on the table. Whoa!

00:36:57.417 --> 00:36:58.997
So it was the moment he set it down.
I see.

00:36:58.997 --> 00:36:59.997
Japanese, Western, and Chinese.
Whoa.

00:37:01.817 --> 00:37:03.918
That's brutal!
This is bad.

00:37:06.118 --> 00:37:11.178
Amazing.
Amazing.

00:37:11.258 --> 00:37:16.658
Seriously, wow... the game masters are
scary. Good work, everyone.

00:37:18.638 --> 00:37:23.218
Good work.
What an incredible match.

00:37:23.698 --> 00:37:28.878
Man. Congratulations on winning the Final
Stage and the 3.5 million yen prize.

00:37:28.998 --> 00:37:32.218
Thank you.
Fair enough.

00:37:32.218 --> 00:37:34.698
Now I'll go eat some actually delicious
food. Yeah.

00:37:35.058 --> 00:37:37.979
And really savor it. And properly eat
Japanese, Western, and Chinese food.

00:37:38.039 --> 00:37:39.799
Go eat all three.
Yes.

00:37:39.799 --> 00:37:41.319
Man, that was amazing.
It really was.

00:37:41.619 --> 00:37:46.499
It was so entertaining,
and these NG setups were just too good.

00:37:46.499 --> 00:37:49.099
Ah, glad to hear that. Wait, you two
really came up with those yourselves?

00:37:49.359 --> 00:37:50.519
We did.
Amazing.

00:37:50.599 --> 00:37:56.599
Yeah, because if we don't come up with
them on site now, we can't keep up anymore. Everyone's too sharp.

00:37:56.859 --> 00:38:01.219
We did have some ideas ready, but then we
thought, 'No, these just aren't on their level anymore.' Ah.

00:38:01.799 --> 00:38:03.759
Wow.
And so, for the first Secret NG House...

00:38:03.859 --> 00:38:04.399
Yes.

00:38:04.399 --> 00:38:06.279
NG House...

00:38:07.229 --> 00:38:14.600
the winner was Ryogo Matsumaru.

00:38:15.700 --> 00:38:22.640
Congratulations.
Yes!!

00:38:22.640 --> 00:38:24.020
Thank goodness.
So strong.
